<section class="card" aria-labelledby="step-preview">
  <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3">
    <h2 id="step-preview" class="step-title">
      <span class="step-badge" aria-hidden="true">
        2
      </span>{' '}
      Preview
    </h2>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
      <button type="button" data-el="restart-preview" class="btn-secondary" disabled>
        Mulai ulang animasi
      </button>
      <button type="button" data-el="open-window" class="btn-secondary" disabled>
        Buka jendela preview
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="hint mt-2">
    Preview berjalan di iframe terisolasi (sandbox tanpa akses ke halaman ini). Resource eksternal (CDN, font, API)
    butuh internet dan bisa gagal karena CORS/CSP atau batasan browser.
  </p>
  <div
    data-el="preview-host"
    class="relative mt-4 flex h-[min(70vh,640px)] min-h-48 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-[repeating-conic-gradient(#e2e8f0_0_25%,#f8fafc_0_50%)] bg-[length:20px_20px] p-2 dark:bg-[repeating-conic-gradient(#1e293b_0_25%,#0f172a_0_50%)]"
  >
    <p data-el="preview-empty" class="hint">
      Belum ada file. Preview akan tampil di sini.
    </p>
  </div>
  <p data-el="preview-meta" class="hint mt-2" aria-live="polite"></p>
  <ul
    data-el="preview-errors"
    class="mt-2 hidden list-disc space-y-1 pl-6 text-sm text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400"
  ></ul>
</section>
